Subject: [PATCH] Size bulk helper pools from performance cores; utility QoS
 network threads in single player

Encode pool: threads beyond default_workers() idle unless the game accepts network connections.
Network pool threads run at utility QoS until a listener opens. Far decoration, far LOD and
region compression pools size from performance cores (horizon_threads::fast_cores).
